--VSC
Alt + Arrow Up,Down = Move Selected
Alt + Arrow Left,Right = Move Tabs
Ctrl + Arrow Up,Down = Mouse Scroll
Ctrl + Arrow Left,Right = Move Words
Arrow left,right = Move Row
Arrow Up,Down = Move Column